1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:00,991
Touch your fingertips

2
00:00:00,991 --> 00:00:02,533
together near your eyes,

3
00:00:02,589 --> 00:00:04,220
and look PAST them.

4
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:05,740
That floating sausage?

5
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:06,724
Congrats...

6
00:00:06,724 --> 00:00:08,533
you are seeing double.

7
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:10,207
Each eye sees your fingers

8
00:00:10,207 --> 00:00:11,560
from its own side.

9
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:12,583
Look past them,

10
00:00:12,583 --> 00:00:14,920
and the two views split.

11
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:15,924
Your brain stacks them

12
00:00:15,924 --> 00:00:16,704
anyway...

13
00:00:16,704 --> 00:00:17,830
and two fingertips

14
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:20,367
overlap into one sausage.

15
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:22,067
Close one eye...

16
00:00:22,122 --> 00:00:23,780
Sausage gone.

17
00:00:23,856 --> 00:00:24,700
Right now,

18
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,130
everything behind your phone

19
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:27,106
is double...

20
00:00:27,106 --> 00:00:28,512
your brain just doesn't

21
00:00:28,512 --> 00:00:29,610
mention it.

22
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:31,910
It's been hiding sausages

23
00:00:31,910 --> 00:00:33,730
your whole life.

